name 'pl-aif-2-U3-pipeline-CFU_2025'
title 'Multiple Choice: Pipelines'
description ''
question '#### **Scenario:**
A music app wants to show users a “Trending Now” playlist.
The app should:
1) Only include songs tagged “pop”,
2) Order those songs from most plays to least plays,
3) Display only the top 5 songs.   **Which pipeline correctly creates this playlist?**'

wrong 'sort songs by plays → filter songs with tag "pop" → take first 5'
wrong 'take first 5 songs → filter songs with tag "pop" → sort by plays'
wrong 'search for "pop" → sort songs alphabetically → take first 5.'
right 'filter songs with tag "pop" → sort songs by plays → take first 5'
allow_multiple_attempts true